WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.688
This static pivot creates three diagnosis columns It
works well

00:00:05.714 --> 00:00:11.399
when those categories are intentionally selected and
stable The advantage

00:00:11.425 --> 00:00:17.038
is a predictable schema The limitation is that any
new diagnosis

00:00:17.064 --> 00:00:20.117
category will not automatically appear as a new
column
